\par\par \b \uc2 HK Bourse: Results Announcement From \uc2 Shandong Weigao Group Medical Polymer Co. Ltd\uc2  .\b0\par\par\uc2 12,878 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2019\par 09:49\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2019, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     For full details, please click on the following link: \par  \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2019/0327/LTN20190327471.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2019/0327/LTN20190327471.pdf }}}\uc2 \f2  \par  \par  \par  \par                       ANNOUNCEMENT OF RESULTS \par                  FOR THE YEAR ENDED 31 DECEMBER 2018 \par     SUMMARY \par     For the year ended 31 December 2018 (the "Year"), the turnover from continuing \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operation\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par     of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Shandong Weigao Group Medical Polymer Company Limited\f28 \uc2 \f2   (the "Company" and \par     together with its subsidiaries, the "Group") was approximately RMB8,808,861,000 (2017: \par     RMB6,292,641,000), representing an increase of 40.0% over the previous year. Net profit \par     attributable to the owners of the Company was approximately RMB1,472,935,000 (2017: \par     approximately RMB1,728,660,000), representing a decrease of approximately 14.8% \par     over the previous year. Net profit attributable to the owners of the Company (excluding \par     extraordinary items) was approximately RMB1,586,834,000 (2017: approximately \par     RMB1,337,592,000), representing an increase of approximately 18.6% over the previous \par     year. During the Year, extraordinary items include increase in cost of good sold of \par     approximately RMB76,962,000 for the current period from inventory appreciation based on \par     valuation resulted from the acquisition of Argon Medical Devices Holdings, Inc. ("Argon") \par     and an one-off transaction expenses of approximately RMB36,937,000 for the acquisition \par     of Argon. (In 2017: extraordinary items recorded an accounting gain for Weigao Blood \par     Purification Products Company Limited ("Weigao Blood Purification") after it became \par     an associate of the Company upon the completion of capital increase, of approximately \par     RMB391,068,000). \par  \par     During the Year, the Group completed the acquisition of Argon through the joint venture \par     which was owned as to 89.8% by Weigao International, a subsidiary of the Group, on 23 \par     January 2018, and Argon became one of the core platforms for overseas development of the \par     Group. \par  \par     The Directors recommended the payment of a final dividend of RMB0.052 per share \par     (2017: RMB0.046), which is subject to the approval by the shareholders of the Company \par     ("Shareholders") at the forthcoming general meeting. \par  \par      For identification purpose only \par * \par  \par                                                               1 \par CONSOLIDATED STATEMENT OF PROFIT OR LOSS AND OTHER \par COMPREHENSIVE INCOME \par FOR THE YEAR ENDED 31 DECEMBER 2018 \par  \par                                                                 2018            2017 \par                                                              RMB '000      RMB '000 \par                                                      NOTES \par                                                                            (restated) \par  \par Continuing \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par                                                        2      8,808,861 \par Revenue                                                                     6,292,641 \par                                                              (3,419,707) \par Cost of sales                                                              (2,299,818) \p