\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Asia leads emerging stocks higher as trade tensions ease\b0\par\par\uc2 483 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Dezember 2018\par 11:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2018 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Huawei\uc2  news, trade relief helps EM stocks\par \par \uc2 * Indian stocks upbeat on new c.bank chief\par \par \uc2 * S. Africa markets, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gain after inflation data\par \par \uc2 By Agamoni Ghosh and Sruthi Shankar\par \par \uc2 Dec 12 (Reuters) - Asian stock markets led gains in emerging markets on Wednesday as signs of an easing of U.S.-China trade tensions boosted investors' appetite for risk, while the dollar held near a one-month high, capping gains in many developing world \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In an interview with Reuters, President \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  sounded upbeat on the chances of a trade deal with \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  and said he would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the \uc2 U.S. Justice Department\uc2  in the case against a Chinese telecommunications executive if it would help.\par \par \uc2 Huawei Technologies Co's Chief Financial Officer \uc2 Meng Wanzhou\uc2 , who was arrested earlier this month in Vancouver on charges of violating U.S. sanctions against Iran, was released on bail on Tuesday, easing concern among financial investors that the case could lead to more tit-for-tat moves by Beijing and Washington.\par \par \uc2 MSCI's index for developing world stocks climbed 1 percent, with Chinese and Hong Kong shares both closing higher.\par \par \uc2 South Korea's main index rose 1.4 percent, buoyed by gains in shares of the country's biggest carmaker, \uc2 Hyundai Motor Co\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The trade news has helped stock markets in Asia rise," said \uc2 William Jackson\uc2 , chief emerging market economist at Capital Economics in London.\par \par \uc2 "Part of the rebound in equities reflects how sharply they fell earlier this week. We may just be seeing a recovery (but) obviously there's been a big element in the news flow."\par \par \uc2 Indian stocks rallied after the government moved quickly to calm markets and appoint a new \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor, picking a former finance ministry official and backer of some of Prime Minister \uc2 Narendra Modi\uc2 's key policies.\par \par \uc2 The prospect of a swing towards the more dovish policy demanded by Modi's administration ahead of next year's elections helped stock markets, but concerns remain among investors about the independence of the bank.\par \par \uc2 Stocks on Johannesburg's main index were at a one-week high after data showed consumer inflation quickened slightly in November in Africa's most industrialised nation. That also boosted the rand.\par \par \uc2 Other emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were mixed as the dollar recovered from sharp falls last week, with the Russian rouble and Turkey's lira weakening. Most Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  including the Chinese yuan and the Indian rupee firmed.\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance 2018, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://tmsnrt.rs/2egbfVh"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://tmsnrt.rs/2egbfVh}}}\uc2  For GRAPHIC on MSCI emerging index performance 2018, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://tmsnrt.rs/2OusNdX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://tmsnrt.rs/2OusNdX}}}\par \par \uc2 For TOP NEWS across emerging markets\par \par \uc2 For CENTRAL EUROPE market report, see\par \par \uc2 For TURKISH market report, see\par \par \uc2 For RUSSIAN market report, see (Reporting by Agamoni Ghosh and Sruthi Shankar in Bengaluru; Editing by Hugh Lawson) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2018-12-12T11:26:19.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020181212eecc01o6p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
