\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-\uc2 U.S. government\uc2  refrains from calling China a  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  manipulator\b0\par\par\uc2 469 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Oktober 2018\par 06:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2018 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds Treasury Department's comments on South Korea, India)\par \par \uc2 By Jason Lange\par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON, Oct 17 (Reuters) - The \uc2 U.S. government\uc2  on Wednesday refrained from naming China or any other trading partner as a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  manipulator, as it leans on import tariffs to try to cut a trade deficit with China.\par \par \uc2 In its semi-annual \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  report, the \uc2 U.S. Treasury Department\uc2  said a recent depreciation of China's yuan \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will likely exacerbate the U.S. trade deficit, but U.S. officials found Beijing appeared to be doing little to directly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's value.\par \par \uc2 U.S. President \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has claimed that China's rise as an exporting powerhouse has hurt U.S. workers and since taking office he has ordered tariffs on more than $200 billion in Chinese imports.\par \par \uc2 "Of particular concern are China's lack of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  transparency and the recent weakness in its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Treasury Secretary \uc2 Steven Mnuchin\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Since the Treasury's last \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  report was issued on April 13, the yuan has fallen by more than 9.0 percent against the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 In the last week, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has pushed closer to the key 7 to the dollar threshold, a level not breached since 2008. Some \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  derivatives show market participants expect the yuan to weaken past that level within a year.\par \par \uc2 The Treasury noted reports that China was trying to counter some of the yuan depreciation and said China could bolster confidence in the yuan by engaging in more market-friendly reforms.\par \par \uc2 "Treasury is deeply disappointed that \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to refrain from disclosing its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," the department said in its report.\par \par \uc2 It added that \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  should advance macroeconomic reforms that support greater household consumption growth and help rebalance the economy away from investment.\par \par \uc2 China's multi-decade investment boom has helped make it the world's factory and fueled a trade surplus in goods with the United States of $390 billion in the 12 months through June.\par \par \uc2 Some China experts have speculated that Beijing could use yuan devaluation as a weapon in a broader trade war with the United States.\par \par \uc2 The Treasury also said it has was keeping China, India, Japan, Germany, South Korea and Switzerland on a monitoring list for extra scrutiny.\par \par \uc2 The Treasury said it was concerned that South Korea stepped up \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets that appeared "to have been for the purpose of slowing won appreciation against the dollar."\par \par \uc2 The Treasury said India was on course to be left off the list when it is next updated in six months. India was added in April after a burst in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales by the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . (Reporting by Jason Lange Editing by Marguerita Choy) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2018-10-18T05:16:33.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020181017eeah03s9m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
